===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A person employed at an [[inn]], [[hostelry]], or [[stable]] to [[look after]] [[horse]]s; a [[groom]]
#* {{RQ:Thackeray Pendennis||passage=As the chaise drove through Clavering, the '''hostler''' standing whistling under the archway of the Clavering Arms, winked the postilion ominously, as much as to say all was over.|2}}
# {{lb|en|by extension}} A person employed to care for a [[locomotive]] or other large engine.

